1. She has a strong connection to Akihabara, having spent a significant amount of time there during a trip to Japan. (Verbatim: "I spent a longer time in Tokyo than I did in the other places so basically I split my trip in kind of two ish...")
2. She visited Kyoto during her Japan trip and encountered a creme brulee van. (Verbatim: "When I was in Kyoto there was a creme brulee van")
3. She has a deep affection for creme brulee, which she associates with anime and childhood memories. (Verbatim: "I love creme brulee I love I love I love creme brulee oh I forgot back in...")
4. She enjoys eating cereal for breakfast, typically in a small bowl due to limited supply. (Verbatim: "I didn't even have a big bowl of cereal. I had a small bowl, because I'm running out.")
5. She drinks apple juice from cartons and uses a straw, hoping it will help wake her up. (Verbatim: "I put the straw in the apple juice, so I'm gonna have hope this apple juice wakes me up.")
6. She struggles with falling asleep and staying asleep, often waking up multiple times during the night. (Verbatim: "I kept like half waking up and I think it was like three something, yeah.")
7. She finds it difficult to relax her mind and body before sleep, noting that her muscles are tense when trying to sleep. (Verbatim: "I didn't realize how tense my muscles are when I go to bed and how not tense my muscles are when I wake up.")
8. She has attempted relaxation techniques, including a brainwave feedback device used in a school setting, but found it ineffective. (Verbatim: "I tried it and it's really hard because like trying not to think is like saying like try not to think of a certain word...")
9. She wants to improve her Japanese language skills for future trips to Japan. (Verbatim: "Next time I go to Japan though I want to be able to speak Japanese better.")
10. She has a particular fondness for salad when dressed with flavorful dressings like Caesar sauce. (Verbatim: "I like Caesar sauce but you can get some nice like vinegars and stuff... salad can taste good.") [end of text]



1. She previously worked at a zoo. (Verbatim: "yeah i looked after tortoise but i never looked after galapagos one or big big one")
2. She cared for rhinos during her time at the zoo. (Verbatim: "i looked after rhinos definitely had the biggest largest amount of poop i had to pick up")
3. She found rhinos to be very cute despite their danger. (Verbatim: "they're just so dangerous with their giant horns and and the fact that they can get so angry but they're actually really cute animals")
4. She had to separate male and female rhinos when the female became grumpy. (Verbatim: "i always had to separate them on grumpy days but when she wasn't grumpy it was okay")
5. She found it difficult to get rhinos to go outside for cleaning, especially in cold weather. (Verbatim: "trying to get the rhino to to go outside for a little bit so i could clean its enclosure when it was cold")
6. She had to bribe rhinos with large amounts of food to get them to move. (Verbatim: "i had to bribe them with so much food um but yeah rhinos are definitely very very very cute")
7. She found the amount of rhino poop to be excessive and required special large barrels for disposal. (Verbatim: "the amount was like pretty much okay you see the size of the rhino imagine like half the size of the rhino but a mountain about that it was insane")
8. She found giraffe urine to be the most unpleasant-smelling animal waste she encountered. (Verbatim: "the smelliest thing was the giraffe um the giraffe pee it was very strong like ammonia smell to it so it was really bad")
9. She was disturbed by the behavior of a female lemur who tried to mate with her offspring. (Verbatim: "this female lemur that kept trying to mate with her children um she was insane she was heckin terrifying")
10. She had to wear protective face gear when handling an aggressive female lemur. (Verbatim: "you had to wear proper face helmet gear because she was so angy and frustrated she was ready to scratch the face of anybody that so much as went near her") [end of text]



1. She has a strong interest in animal biology and conservation efforts. (Verbatim: "I did animal biology so um and i i care a lot about animals so yeah yeah yeah")
2. She has worked at a zoo in the past. (Verbatim: "my perspective on zoos as someone that's like worked at one is there are good ones and bad ones")
3. She is familiar with the ethical and scientific aspects of zoo conservation programs. (Verbatim: "they have very like intensive breeding programs where they try and match up genetics to prevent bottlenecks")
4. She is aware of the risks associated with releasing zoo animals into the wild. (Verbatim: "there's a lot of cases where people don't fully research and just blanket say zoos are bad i'm gonna free all the animals and it's like no no no no don't don't do that please can we think about this a bit")
5. She has personal experience with illegal breeding and transport of leopard tortoises. (Verbatim: "i remember doing a lot about um tortoises um and yeah they're definitely something that um yeah was um ah yeah yeah it's a whole topic")
6. She values zoos that are part of formal conservation programs like BIAZA in England. (Verbatim: "in england we have something called biazza which is um an zoo association process")
7. She has visited a very small tonkatsu restaurant in Shibuya with only nine seats. (Verbatim: "this is a very very very very very small restaurant in um in shibuya that i went to")
8. She queued for one and a half hours at a hot, crowded restaurant in Shibuya. (Verbatim: "i had to queue for an hour and a half so one hour 30 minutes i queued in the hot hot hot hot weather")
9. She appreciates restaurants that provide step-by-step instructions for eating their dishes. (Verbatim: "they said to step one was drink the miso soup and step two was i can't remember something about eating or eating something i don't know but but but it was quite an experience")
10. She has visited a family-run tempura-ya in Shibuya run by an elderly woman. (Verbatim: "there was another place i went to actually um that i do recommend um that was also that was also in shibuya um but i couldn't i didn't take pictures because i didn't i i felt like it might have been rude") [end of text]



1. She has a bachelor's degree in animal biology. (Verbatim: "animal biology is in my bachelor's degree")
2. She has a master's degree in AI and machine learning technology. (Verbatim: "i went to my master's degree to do my ai")
3. She is interested in artificial intelligence. (Verbatim: "as you know i have quite an interest in um i have quite an interest in ai")
4. She enjoys eating macarons and crème brûlée. (Verbatim: "i love macarons um um again macarons i like macarons and creme brulee's i really love like those are the two foods i'll always try and get if i can")
5. She likes wearing cute, frilly clothing. (Verbatim: "i do like cute frilly frilly things as much as i love my anime t-shirts")
6. She finds outdated technology disappointing. (Verbatim: "but yeah this place they like welcome you in and then there's like a different robot that like guides you to your seat and then okay they had like a pop-up theme up there um so um basically you got your this was a donut with a macaron on top and this was a really weird drink where they printed the picture on it um and this robot as you can see in the background has its arms up um i asked it a lot of questions so it's like um it's just like a trained ai that you speak to and i am well they had a few options you could either talk to it you could have it entertain you it could um play games with you so here the reason its arms are up is because i asked it to rap for me um and and i recommend if you go ask asking it to rap for you um like do it ask for the rap the rap is definitely the best entertainment from this machine um but also it didn't end i think it's got stuck it's in japanese it rapped in japanese um but it didn't end and it was really awkward because it was just like people were looking at me and it wouldn't stop rapping and i was like i don't know when it stops rapping because like i had it i had it sing a few other songs and it was okay but this one was just it just kept going and going and going and i was like and then it it restarted and i was like uh oh did i break it is this is this robot doomed to wrap for the rest of eternity to me so i just let it wrap for a bit and it eventually gave up um but it just kept going i did ask it um a few things i asked it um i asked it for the date and time which it did not pass um it first it said it was redacted and then it said it was 2021 and i was like no it's 2023 and then it said it was 2022 and i was like and then i tried to get some information from it i was like when were you last updated um and and yeah it was this it was this um yeah it was like it's redacted o'clock and i was like oh no it just didn't say anything it was just it was just blank and i was like that's not a time um but i feel like these robots may not have been updated since like 2021 based on the information that i was getting from it um yes they're quite they're a little on the outdated side um which was a bit sad but it could wrap so it earned points back with its wrapping um yeah it's um it was interesting i did ask it um oh i took other pictures but i um i did ask it for anime recommendation the problem is the screen um the screen and the robot itself really clean um too clean because um it's so reflective um so i did ask it for like anime recommendations and it did recommend some stuff um and well it recommended what did it um wait let me quickly try and find i'm pretty certain it recommended um sword art online or something i'm pretty certain that's what it was it recommended something and i was like eh um wait let me see if i can find it if i go here and search for robot though i wonder if i can find okay okay no i asked it to try and like oh i was trying to get it to like um tell me secrets in binary code but it didn't it just messed up and say is your favorite of course it is speak at your curie tail in disguise i see you jewel wielding i see you jewel wielding i yeah how do i how do i um okay here it is okay i was like tell me your secrets in binary code thinking i could get around it okay it recommended attack on titan as well that was it it recommended attack on titan and saw it out online so then i said can you recommend something less well known something that's underrated so it said certainly one underrated anime series that i highly recommend is blast of tempest it's a high fantasy story with great animation engaging characters and plot twists if you're looking for something thought-provoking yet entertaining then this might be right up your story another option could be the intense psychological thriller paranoia agent so yeah it did come up with other options which i thought was interesting um yeah it also recommended death note at one point um but um yeah it did try it did try and go for for um yeah lesser known ones which i thought was interesting um yeah it also recommended death note at one point um but um yeah it did try it did try and go for for um yeah lesser known ones which i thought was interesting um yeah it also recommended death note at one point um but um yeah it did try it did try and go for for um yeah lesser known ones which i thought was interesting um yeah it also recommended death note at one point um but um yeah it did try it did try and go for for um yeah lesser known ones which i thought was interesting um yeah it also recommended death note at one point um but um yeah it did try it did try and go for for um yeah lesser known ones which i thought was interesting um yeah it also recommended death note at one point um but um yeah it did try it did try and go for for um yeah lesser known ones which i thought was interesting um yeah it also recommended death note at one point um but um yeah it did try it did try and go for for um yeah lesser known ones which i thought was interesting um yeah it also recommended death note at one point um but um yeah it did try it did try and go for for um yeah lesser known ones which i thought was interesting um yeah it also recommended death note at one point um but um yeah it did try it did try and go for for um yeah lesser known ones which i thought was interesting um yeah it also recommended death note at one point um but um yeah it did try it did try and go for for um yeah lesser known ones which i thought was interesting um yeah it also recommended death note at one point um but um yeah it did try it did try and go for for um yeah lesser known ones which i thought was interesting um yeah it also recommended death note at one point um but um yeah it did try it did try and go for for um yeah lesser known ones which i thought was interesting um yeah it also recommended death note at one point um but um yeah it did try it did try an