10. She received a plastic "Princess" loyalty card after her visit to a maid cafe. (Verbatim: "i actually have a princess card because i'm not a master no no no ladies are princesses and the guys are masters") [end of text]



1. She visited a maid cafe in Akihabara. (Verbatim: "this one was in akihabara and and yeah i think i just looked up best maid cafes and this one came up so i went to it")
