1. She finds art and technology integration fascinating. (Verbatim: "I find art very interesting and I think the reason I found the art so interesting at team lab is because it's sort of it was um it was them incorporating technology into their art")
2. She experienced motion sickness in a room at Team Lab that required lying down and looking up at projections. (Verbatim: "At first it was scary because um it actually made me a bit um motion sick at first because I got worried because I rely on my eyes a lot and it made me quite dizzy")
3. She enjoys the Splatoon video game franchise, as evidenced by her purchase of Splatoon-themed ice cream. (Verbatim: "I got the splatoon flavor so this one here you see this weird moldy colored one that's the splatoon flavored ice cream")
4. She has a half-built Gunpla model of Ariel from Witch of Mercury. (Verbatim: "I've already half built it so um yeah I searched this store with a list that ellie bro gave me")
5. She values completing her Gunpla models with her audience, planning to finish her Ariel model during a live stream after her debut. (Verbatim: "I want to finish it on hand cam with you all but that's post debut content not pre-debut content you know")
